{"code":"bn","name":"Bengali","native":"বাংলা","phase":2,"medium":"en","file_level":"A1","pronunciation":[{"t":"অ sounds like Ô (as in 'gone')","r":"ô","tip":"কমল (kômol) = lotus. Round and open — never 'a'!"},{"t":"আ is a long open AA","r":"aa","tip":"বাবা (baba) = father. অ vs আ — short-ô vs long-aa!"},{"t":"ট ঠ ড ঢ curl the tongue BACK","r":"ṭa ṭha ḍa ḍha","tip":"টমেটো (ṭomeṭo) = tomato. Roof-of-mouth sounds!"},{"t":"Aspirates burst air: খ ঘ ছ ঝ","r":"kha gha chha jha","tip":"খাবার (khabar) = food. Feel the puff!"},{"t":"য় is a soft faint Y","r":"~y","tip":"যায় (jay) = goes. Barely touch it — a whisper of Y!"}],"alphabet":{"title":"Bengali script: vowels + consonants","explain":"Bengali script flows left-to-right with a headline bar, cousin of Devanagari! Vowels first, then consonant families (ক-row, চ-row, ট-row, ত-row, প-row). Vowel signs join consonants: ক + া = কা!","letters":[{"t":"অ","r":"ô (as in gone)"},{"t":"আ","r":"aa"},{"t":"ই","r":"i (short)"},{"t":"ঈ","r":"ee (long)"},{"t":"উ","r":"u (short)"},{"t":"ঊ","r":"oo (long)"},{"t":"ঋ","r":"ri"},{"t":"এ","r":"e (eh)"},{"t":"ঐ","r":"oi"},{"t":"ও","r":"o (oh)"},{"t":"ঔ","r":"ou"},{"t":"ক","r":"kô"},{"t":"খ","r":"kha"},{"t":"গ","r":"gô"},{"t":"ঘ","r":"gha"},{"t":"চ","r":"chô"},{"t":"ছ","r":"chha"},{"t":"জ","r":"jô"},{"t":"ঝ","r":"jha"},{"t":"ট","r":"ṭa (retroflex)"},{"t":"ঠ","r":"ṭha"},{"t":"ড","r":"ḍa"},{"t":"ঢ","r":"ḍha"},{"t":"ত","r":"tô (dental)"},{"t":"থ","r":"tha"},{"t":"দ","r":"dô"},{"t":"ধ","r":"dha"},{"t":"ন","r":"nô"},{"t":"প","r":"pô"},{"t":"ফ","r":"pha"},{"t":"ব","r":"bô"},{"t":"ভ","r":"bha"},{"t":"ম","r":"mô"},{"t":"য","r":"jô"},{"t":"র","r":"rô (flapped)"},{"t":"ল","r":"lô"},{"t":"শ","r":"shô"},{"t":"ষ","r":"ṣa"},{"t":"স","r":"sô"},{"t":"হ","r":"hô"}]},"counting":{"title":"Counting 0 to 100","explain":"Bengali numbers 1–20 are unique — learn them by heart! Tens (বিশ, ত্রিশ…) then fuse: একুশ = 21. 100 = একশো!","numbers":[{"t":"শূন্য","r":"shunyo","en":"0"},{"t":"এক","r":"æk","en":"1"},{"t":"দুই","r":"dui","en":"2"},{"t":"তিন","r":"tin","en":"3"},{"t":"চার","r":"char","en":"4"},{"t":"পাঁচ","r":"pãch","en":"5"},{"t":"ছয়","r":"chhôy","en":"6"},{"t":"সাত","r":"shat","en":"7"},{"t":"আট","r":"aṭ","en":"8"},{"t":"নয়","r":"nôy","en":"9"},{"t":"দশ","r":"dôsh","en":"10"},{"t":"এগারো","r":"ægaro","en":"11"},{"t":"বারো","r":"baro","en":"12"},{"t":"তেরো","r":"tero","en":"13"},{"t":"চৌদ্দ","r":"chouddo","en":"14"},{"t":"পনেরো","r":"ponero","en":"15"},{"t":"ষোলো","r":"sholo","en":"16"},{"t":"সতেরো","r":"shotero","en":"17"},{"t":"আঠারো","r":"aṭharo","en":"18"},{"t":"ঊনিশ","r":"unish","en":"19"},{"t":"বিশ","r":"bish","en":"20"},{"t":"ত্রিশ","r":"trish","en":"30"},{"t":"চল্লিশ","r":"chollish","en":"40"},{"t":"পঞ্চাশ","r":"pônchash","en":"50"},{"t":"ষাট","r":"shaṭ","en":"60"},{"t":"সত্তর","r":"shottor","en":"70"},{"t":"আশি","r":"ashi","en":"80"},{"t":"নব্বই","r":"nobboi","en":"90"},{"t":"একশো","r":"æksho","en":"100"}],"rules":["1–20 are unique: এক, দুই, তিন… বিশ — memorise them.","21+ fuses: একুশ (21), বাইশ (22). টা counts things: দুটো বই = two books!"]},"level":{"title":"Starter: greetings, আছে, first verbs","goals":["Greet people and introduce yourself","Use আছে, এটা/ওটা and plurals","Use present verbs and say 'I have'"],"units":[{"id":"A1-U1","title":"First words","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U1-L1","title":"Greetings: নমস্কার","learn":"নমস্কার (hello — I bow to you!). Meeting: আমি + name → আপনার সঙ্গে দেখা করে খুশি হলাম (happy to meet you)! Fold hands, smile warmly!","vocab":[{"t":"নমস্কার","r":"nômoshkar","en":"hello","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"আদাব","r":"adab","en":"hello (Muslim greeting)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"সুপ্রভাত","r":"shuprobhat","en":"good morning","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"শুভ সন্ধ্যা","r":"shubho shondha","en":"good evening","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ধন্যবাদ","r":"dhonyobad","en":"thank you","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"মাফ করবেন","r":"maph kôrben","en":"sorry / excuse me","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"হ্যাঁ","r":"hyãn","en":"yes","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"না","r":"na","en":"no / not","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"আমিX + খুশি হলাম","explain":"আমি মিতা = I am Mita (no verb needed!). আপনার সঙ্গে দেখা করে খুশি হলাম = meeting-you brought joy!","pattern":"আমি + name","examples":[{"t":"নমস্কার, আমি মিতা।","r":"nômoshkar, ami Mita.","en":"Hello, I am Mita."},{"t":"আপনার সঙ্গে দেখা করে খুশি হলাম!","r":"apnar shônge dekha kôre khushi hôlam!","en":"Nice to meet you!"},{"t":"ধন্যবাদ!","r":"dhonyobad!","en":"Thanks!"}],"mistakes":["Adding আছে after আমি মিতা — names need NO verb!","Saying তুমি to elders — use আপনি!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"নমস্কার, আমি মিতা।","r":"nômoshkar, ami Mita.","en":"Hello, I am Mita."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"নমস্কার, আমি রাতুল।","r":"nômoshkar, ami Ratul.","en":"Hello, I am Ratul."},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আপনার সঙ্গে দেখা করে খুশি হলাম!","r":"apnar shônge dekha kôre khushi hôlam!","en":"Nice to meet you!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমিও!","r":"amio!","en":"Me too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I am Mita","answer":"আমি মিতা"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (Nice to meet you)","answer":"আপনার সঙ্গে দেখা করে খুশি হলাম"},{"type":"choose","q":"To elders you say…","options":["তুমি","আপনি","তুই","এরা"],"answer":"আপনি"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: মিতা / আমি","answer":"আমি মিতা"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমি মিতা।","answer":"আমি মিতা।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"নমস্কার means…","options":["goodbye","hello (I bow)","thanks","sorry"],"answer":1,"why":"নমস্কার = hello with respect."},{"q":"খুশি হলাম phrase means…","options":["thank you","nice to meet you","excuse me","good luck"],"answer":1,"why":"Meeting-joy phrase."},{"q":"মাফ করবেন means…","options":["thanks","sorry / excuse me","hello","yes"],"answer":1,"why":"মাফ করবেন = formal sorry."},{"q":"আমিও means…","options":["goodbye","me too","never","maybe"],"answer":1,"why":"আমি + ও = me-too."},{"q":"আমি মিতা needs…","options":["আছে","no verb","হয়","হলাম"],"answer":1,"why":"Names stand alone!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Greetings worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["hello","thank you","yes"],"key":["নমস্কার","ধন্যবাদ","হ্যাঁ"]},{"instruction":"Introduce yourself.","items":["Hello, I am Mita","Nice to meet you"],"key":["নমস্কার, আমি মিতা","আপনার সঙ্গে দেখা করে খুশি হলাম"]},{"instruction":"Dayparts.","items":["good morning","good evening"],"key":["সুপ্রভাত","শুভ সন্ধ্যা"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U1-L2","title":"Names and আপনি কেমন আছেন","learn":"Ask names: আপনার নাম কী? (what is your name?) → আমার নাম… How are you: আপনি কেমন আছেন? → আমি ভালো আছি! আছি/আছো/আছে/আছেন — BE for everyone!","vocab":[{"t":"আমি","r":"ami","en":"I","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"আপনি","r":"apni","en":"you (formal)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"নাম","r":"nam","en":"name","pos":"noun"},{"t":"আপনার নাম কী","r":"apnar nam ki","en":"what is your name","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"আমার নাম","r":"amar nam","en":"my name","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"আপনি কেমন আছেন","r":"apni kæmon achhen","en":"how are you","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"আমি ভালো আছি","r":"ami bhalo achhi","en":"I'm fine","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"দয়া করে","r":"dôya kôre","en":"please","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"আছি/আছো/আছে/আছেন","explain":"আমি আছি (I am), তুমি আছো (you-casual are), সে আছে (he/she is), আপনি আছেন (you-formal are)!","pattern":"আমি আছি · তুমি আছো · সে আছে · আপনি আছেন","examples":[{"t":"আপনি কেমন আছেন?","r":"apni kæmon achhen?","en":"How are you? (formal)"},{"t":"আমি ভালো আছি!","r":"ami bhalo achhi!","en":"I'm fine!"},{"t":"আপনার নাম কী?","r":"apnar nam ki?","en":"What is your name?"}],"mistakes":["Saying আমি আছেন — আমি takes আছি!","Saying আপনি আছে — আপনি takes আছেন!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আপনার নাম কী?","r":"apnar nam ki?","en":"What is your name?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমার নাম মিতা। আপনি কেমন আছেন?","r":"amar nam Mita. apni kæmon achhen?","en":"My name is Mita. How are you?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমি ভালো আছি! আর আপনি?","r":"ami bhalo achhi! ar apni?","en":"I'm fine! And you?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমিও ভালো আছি!","r":"amio bhalo achhi!","en":"I'm fine too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How are you? (formal)","answer":"আপনি কেমন আছেন"},{"type":"fill","q":"আমি ___ আছি! (fine)","answer":"ভালো"},{"type":"choose","q":"আমি takes…","options":["আছেন","আছি","আছো","আছে"],"answer":"আছি"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: আছেন / কেমন / আপনি","answer":"আপনি কেমন আছেন"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আপনি কেমন আছেন?","answer":"আপনি কেমন আছেন?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আপনার নাম কী? asks…","options":["my name","your name","his name","no name"],"answer":1,"why":"আপনার নাম = your name."},{"q":"আমি ভালো আছি means…","options":["not well","I'm fine","so-so","busy"],"answer":1,"why":"ভালো = good/fine."},{"q":"আর আপনি? means…","options":["who are you","and you?","where are you","why you"],"answer":1,"why":"আর = and."},{"q":"সে takes…","options":["আছি","আছো","আছে","আছেন"],"answer":2,"why":"সে + আছে."},{"q":"দয়া করে means…","options":["thanks","please","sorry","hello"],"answer":1,"why":"দয়া করে = please."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"BE-forms worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["I","you (formal)","name"],"key":["আমি","আপনি","নাম"]},{"instruction":"Match আছি/আছো/আছে/আছেন.","items":["How are you? (formal)","I'm fine!","What is your name?"],"key":["আপনি কেমন আছেন","আমি ভালো আছি","আপনার নাম কী"]},{"instruction":"Answer.","items":["And you?","I'm fine too!"],"key":["আর আপনি","আমিও ভালো আছি"]}]}}]},{"id":"A1-U2","title":"আছে and plurals","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U2-L1","title":"আছে and এটা/ওটা","learn":"Point! এটা (this), ওটা (that). এটা বই = This is a book ( আছে optional here!). Not: নয় — এটা বই নয়! Great news: adjectives NEVER change — বড় ছেলে, বড় মেয়ে!","vocab":[{"t":"এটা","r":"æṭa","en":"this","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"ওটা","r":"oṭa","en":"that","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"বই","r":"boi","en":"book","pos":"noun"},{"t":"স্কুল","r":"skul","en":"school","pos":"noun"},{"t":"গাড়ি","r":"gaṛi","en":"car","pos":"noun"},{"t":"বড়","r":"bôṛo","en":"big","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"ছোট","r":"chhoṭo","en":"small","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"বাড়ি","r":"baṛi","en":"house","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"এটাX · নয় · frozen adjectives","explain":"এটা বই (this is a book), ওটা স্কুল (that is a school). Negative: এটা বই নয়! Adjectives never inflect: বড় ছেলে, বড় মেয়ে — same বড়!","pattern":"এটা/ওটা + X · নয় negates","examples":[{"t":"এটা বই।","r":"æṭa boi.","en":"This is a book."},{"t":"ওটা বড় বাড়ি।","r":"oṭa bôṛo baṛi.","en":"That is a big house."},{"t":"এটা বই নয়।","r":"æṭa boi nôy.","en":"This is not a book."}],"mistakes":["Saying না for 'is not' — identity needs নয়!","Changing বড় by gender — Bengali adjectives NEVER change!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"এটা কি বই?","r":"æṭa ki boi?","en":"Is this a book?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"হ্যাঁ, এটা বড় বই।","r":"hyãn, æṭa bôṛo boi.","en":"Yes, this is a big book."},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"ওটা কি স্কুল?","r":"oṭa ki skul?","en":"Is that a school?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"হ্যাঁ!","r":"hyãn!","en":"Yes!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: This is a book","answer":"এটা বই"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ স্কুল। (That is)","answer":"ওটা"},{"type":"choose","q":"'This is not a book' is…","options":["এটা বই","এটা বই নয়","এটা নয় বই","এটা না বই"],"answer":"এটা বই নয়"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: বই / এটা","answer":"এটা বই"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: এটা বই।","answer":"এটা বই।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"নয় means…","options":["no (answer)","is not","not (verbs)","never"],"answer":1,"why":"এটা বই নয় = is-not."},{"q":"Adjectives in Bengali…","options":["change gender","never change","add -গুলো","need আছে"],"answer":1,"why":"বড় for all — frozen!"},{"q":"এটা কি বই? uses কি to…","options":["point","ask yes/no","negate","count"],"answer":1,"why":"কি = yes/no question."},{"q":"ওটা means…","options":["this","that","here","what"],"answer":1,"why":"ওটা = that."},{"q":"বাড়ি means…","options":["school","house","car","book"],"answer":1,"why":"বাড়ি = house."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Pointing worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["this","that","book"],"key":["এটা","ওটা","বই"]},{"instruction":"Point and name.","items":["This is a book","That is a school","This is not a book"],"key":["এটা বই","ওটা স্কুল","এটা বই নয়"]},{"instruction":"Frozen adjectives.","items":["a big book","a big house"],"key":["বড় বই","বড় বাড়ি"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U2-L2","title":"Plurals: -গুলো/-রা","learn":"Plurals are easy! Things: বই → বইগুলো (books). People: ছেলে → ছেলেরা (boys)! Count things with টা: দুটো বই (two books)! কয়টা? = How many?","vocab":[{"t":"এক","r":"æk","en":"one","pos":"number"},{"t":"দুই","r":"dui","en":"two","pos":"number"},{"t":"তিন","r":"tin","en":"three","pos":"number"},{"t":"বইগুলো","r":"boigulo","en":"books","pos":"noun"},{"t":"মানুষ","r":"manush","en":"people","pos":"noun"},{"t":"অনেক","r":"ônek","en":"many / a lot","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"একটু","r":"ækṭu","en":"a little","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"কয়টা","r":"kôyṭa","en":"how many (things)","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"-গুলো (things) · -রা (people)","explain":"বইগুলো (books), গাড়িগুলো (cars). People: ছেলেরা (boys), মেয়েরা (girls)! দুটো বই (two books), কয়টা বই? (how many books?)!","pattern":"-গুলো things · -রা people · টা counter","examples":[{"t":"আমার বইগুলো আছে।","r":"amar boigulo achhe.","en":"I have books."},{"t":"কয়টা বই?","r":"kôyṭa boi?","en":"How many books?"},{"t":"তিনটে মেয়ে।","r":"tinṭe meye.","en":"Three girls."}],"mistakes":["Saying বইরা — things take -গুলো!","Saying ছেলেগুলো for boys — people: ছেলেরা!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"কয়টা বই আছে?","r":"kôyṭa boi achhe?","en":"How many books are there?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"তিনটে বই!","r":"tinṭe boi!","en":"Three books!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"অনেক ভালো!","r":"ônek bhalo!","en":"Very good!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"ধন্যবাদ!","r":"dhonyobad!","en":"Thanks!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Three books!","answer":"তিনটে বই"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ বই আছে? (How many?)","answer":"কয়টা"},{"type":"choose","q":"ছেলে → plural is…","options":["ছেলেগুলো","ছেলেরা","ছেলেটা","ছেলেদের"],"answer":"ছেলেরা"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: বই / তিনটে","answer":"তিনটে বই"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: তিনটে বই!","answer":"তিনটে বই!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"-গুলো is for…","options":["people","things","verbs","places"],"answer":1,"why":"বইগুলো — things."},{"q":"-রা is for…","options":["things","people","verbs","places"],"answer":1,"why":"ছেলেরা — people."},{"q":"দুটো বই means…","options":["some books","two books","many books","my book"],"answer":1,"why":"দু + টো = two-things."},{"q":"অনেক means…","options":["few","many / a lot","all","some"],"answer":1,"why":"অনেক = many."},{"q":"মানুষ means…","options":["boys","people","books","girls"],"answer":1,"why":"মানুষ = people."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Plurals worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["books","people","many"],"key":["বইগুলো","মানুষ","অনেক"]},{"instruction":"Make plurals.","items":["বই → …","ছেলে → …","মেয়ে → …"],"key":["বইগুলো","ছেলেরা","মেয়েরা"]},{"instruction":"Count.","items":["How many books?","Three books!"],"key":["কয়টা বই আছে","তিনটে বই"]}]}}]},{"id":"A1-U3","title":"First verbs","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U3-L1","title":"Present: খাই/খাচ্ছি","learn":"Two presents, ZERO gender! খাই = I eat (habit), খাচ্ছি = I am eating (NOW). -ই habitual, -চ্ছি continuous! Boys and girls — SAME forms!","vocab":[{"t":"খাওয়া","r":"khaoa","en":"to eat","pos":"verb"},{"t":"পান করা","r":"pan kôra","en":"to drink","pos":"verb"},{"t":"পড়া","r":"pôṛa","en":"to read / study","pos":"verb"},{"t":"লেখা","r":"lekha","en":"to write","pos":"verb"},{"t":"বলা","r":"bôla","en":"to speak","pos":"verb"},{"t":"শেখা","r":"shekha","en":"to learn","pos":"verb"},{"t":"কাজ করা","r":"kaj kôra","en":"to work","pos":"verb"},{"t":"থাকা","r":"thaka","en":"to live / stay","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"-ই (habit) · -চ্ছি (now)","explain":"আমি খাই (I eat), আমি খাচ্ছি (I am eating). তুমি খাও, সে খায়, আপনি খান! No gender anywhere!","pattern":"root + ই/ও/য়/ন · চ্ছি/চ্ছো/চ্ছে/চ্ছেন","examples":[{"t":"আমি বাংলা বলি।","r":"ami bangla bôli.","en":"I speak Bengali."},{"t":"আমি খাচ্ছি।","r":"ami khachchhi.","en":"I am eating."},{"t":"সে পড়ে।","r":"she pôṛe.","en":"He/she reads."}],"mistakes":["Adding gender: Bengali verbs NEVER change gender!","Saying খাচ্ছি for habits — habits: খাই!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আপনি কি ইংরেজি বলেন?","r":"apni ki ingreji bôlen?","en":"Do you speak English? (formal)"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"হ্যাঁ, বলি! আর আপনি?","r":"hyãn, bôli! ar apni?","en":"Yes, I speak! And you?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমি বাংলা বলি!","r":"ami bangla bôli!","en":"I speak Bengali!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"খুব ভালো!","r":"khub bhalo!","en":"Excellent!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I speak Bengali","answer":"আমি বাংলা বলি"},{"type":"fill","q":"আমি ___। (am eating)","answer":"খাচ্ছি"},{"type":"choose","q":"'He/she reads' is…","options":["সে পড়ি","সে পড়ে","সে পড়ো","সে পড়েন"],"answer":"সে পড়ে"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: বলি / বাংলা / আমি","answer":"আমি বাংলা বলি"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমি বাংলা বলি।","answer":"আমি বাংলা বলি।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"খাই means…","options":["I am eating","I eat (habit)","I ate","I will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"-ই = habitual."},{"q":"খাচ্ছি means…","options":["I eat (habit)","I am eating","I ate","I can eat"],"answer":1,"why":"-চ্ছি = continuous."},{"q":"Gender in verbs?","options":["boys -ও","girls -ই","none at all","formal only"],"answer":2,"why":"Zero gender — same all!."},{"q":"আপনি বলেন uses -েন because…","options":["past","formal","feminine","future"],"answer":1,"why":"আপনি = -েন forms."},{"q":"শেখা means…","options":["to teach","to learn","to read","to forget"],"answer":1,"why":"শেখা = to learn."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Present verbs worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["to eat","to speak","to learn"],"key":["খাওয়া","বলা","শেখা"]},{"instruction":"-ই/-চ্ছি.","items":["I speak Bengali","I am eating","He/she reads"],"key":["আমি বাংলা বলি","আমি খাচ্ছি","সে পড়ে"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["Do you speak English? (formal)","Excellent!"],"key":["আপনি কি ইংরেজি বলেন","খুব ভালো"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U3-L2","title":"আমার আছে + এ/তে","learn":"HAVE = আমার…আছে! আমার বই আছে (I have a book). Don't-have: নেই! আমার টাকা নেই (I have no money). Places: এ/তে (in/at): বাড়িতে (at home)!","vocab":[{"t":"কাছে","r":"kachhe","en":"near / with","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"আছে","r":"achhe","en":"is / have","pos":"verb"},{"t":"জল","r":"jôl","en":"water","pos":"noun"},{"t":"বাড়ি","r":"baṛi","en":"house","pos":"noun"},{"t":"টাকা","r":"ṭaka","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"বন্ধু","r":"bondhu","en":"friend","pos":"noun"},{"t":"সময়","r":"shômôy","en":"time","pos":"noun"},{"t":"রুটি","r":"ruṭi","en":"bread","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"আমার X আছে · নেই · এ/তে","explain":"আমার বই আছে (I have a book), আপনার জল আছে? (do you have water?), আমার টাকা নেই (no money). বাড়িতে = at home!","pattern":"আমার/আপনার + X + আছে/নেই","examples":[{"t":"আমার বই আছে।","r":"amar boi achhe.","en":"I have a book."},{"t":"আপনার জল আছে?","r":"apnar jôl achhe?","en":"Do you have water?"},{"t":"আমার টাকা নেই।","r":"amar ṭaka nei.","en":"I have no money."}],"mistakes":["Saying না আছে — not-have is নেই (one word)!","Saying বাড়ি for 'at home' — at-home: বাড়িতে!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আপনার জল আছে?","r":"apnar jôl achhe?","en":"Do you have water?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"হ্যাঁ, আমার জল আর রুটি আছে।","r":"hyãn, amar jôl ar ruṭi achhe.","en":"Yes, I have water and bread."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"ধন্যবাদ! আমার টাকা নেই।","r":"dhonyobad! amar ṭaka nei.","en":"Thanks! I have no money."},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"কোনো ব্যাপার না!","r":"kono byapar na!","en":"No problem!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have a book","answer":"আমার বই আছে"},{"type":"fill","q":"আমার টাকা ___। (no)","answer":"নেই"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Do you have water?' is…","options":["আপনি জল খান","আপনার জল আছে","আপনি জল চান","জল কোথায়"],"answer":"আপনার জল আছে"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: আছে / বই / আমার","answer":"আমার বই আছে"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমার জল আর রুটি আছে।","answer":"আমার জল আর রুটি আছে।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আমার বই আছে means…","options":["I want a book","I have a book","I read a book","I see a book"],"answer":1,"why":"আমার…আছে = I have."},{"q":"নেই means…","options":["have","don't have / isn't","want","see"],"answer":1,"why":"নেই = not-exist."},{"q":"বাড়িতে means…","options":["my house","at home","go home","big house"],"answer":1,"why":"তে = at."},{"q":"বন্ধু means…","options":["book","friend","money","time"],"answer":1,"why":"বন্ধু = friend."},{"q":"রুটি means…","options":["water","bread","rice","milk"],"answer":1,"why":"রুটি = flatbread."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"আছে worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["I have (my)","money","friend"],"key":["আমার","টাকা","বন্ধু"]},{"instruction":"Have things.","items":["I have a book","Do you have water?","I have no money"],"key":["আমার বই আছে","আপনার জল আছে","আমার টাকা নেই"]},{"instruction":"Places.","items":["At home","No problem!"],"key":["বাড়িতে","কোনো ব্যাপার না"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"A1 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I am Mita","answer":"আমি মিতা"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (Nice to meet you)","answer":"আপনার সঙ্গে দেখা করে খুশি হলাম"},{"type":"choose","q":"To elders you say…","options":["তুমি","আপনি","তুই","এরা"],"answer":"আপনি"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I speak Bengali","answer":"আমি বাংলা বলি"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"আমার বই আছে।","answer":"I have a book."},{"type":"fill","q":"___ স্কুল। (That is)","answer":"ওটা"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: আছেন / কেমন / আপনি","answer":"আপনি কেমন আছেন"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমি বাংলা বলি।","answer":"আমি বাংলা বলি।"},{"type":"fill","q":"আমার টাকা ___। (no)","answer":"নেই"},{"type":"choose","q":"আমি খাচ্ছি।","options":["I eat (habit)","I am eating","I ate","I will eat"],"answer":"I am eating"}]}}}